ifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["The XFS user quota is attached to the root filesystem, so it limits all data owned by datauser on that filesystem rather than accounting exclusively within /srv/data. This still directly enforces the requested maximum under /srv/data but is broader in scope.","The final contents of /etc were not inventoried; retention of /etc/fstab.before-datauser-quota is inferred from its successful creation and the absence of a cleanup command in the complete timeline."]}
